  "note": "The runner factory joined the runner's arguments, the target and the caller's arguments into one ProcessStartInfo.Arguments string that the OS re-tokenizes, so a quote in an argument injects more. The factory is AlastairLundy.CliInvoke RunnerProcessFactory in 2.0, CliInvoke RunnerProcessFactory in the renamed 2.x package and RunnerConfigurationFactory in 3.x. Reached wherever the app runs a command through a runner.",
